It's possible in theory.  But remember, you will have to kill some monsters
to get all the intrinsics, and obviously you should kill the Wiz.  It's
actually possible to not kill him... you could just push a boulder into the
moat, break through the wall, throw something at him to wake him up, then
walk past him, grab the amulet, and run.  But it would be tough.
In theory, it's possible.  In practice, pretty hard.



